import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 314 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Law-First Comparison: How Heng Yuan Zhou Avoids Realm Inflation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 314 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Law-First Comparison: How Heng Yuan Zhou Avoids Realm Inflation","no":314,"module":2,"tags":["Shrouding the Heavens","Law-First","Realm Inflation","Comparative Analysis","Law Precedes"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","97-Setting Contradiction Self-Check Table","04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0314_模块2-遮天-法则优先对照.md","filePath":"en/0314_模块2-遮天-法则优先对照.md"}'),a={name:"en/0314_模块2-遮天-法则优先对照.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,d,u){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-314-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-law-first-comparison-how-heng-yuan-zhou-avoids-realm-inflation" tabindex="-1">Entry 314 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Law-First Comparison: How Heng Yuan Zhou Avoids Realm Inflation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-314-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-law-first-comparison-how-heng-yuan-zhou-avoids-realm-inflation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 314 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Law-First Comparison: How Heng Yuan Zhou Avoids Realm Inflation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Shrouding-the-Heavens System (Entry 27) | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 97, 04</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-why-heng-yuan-zhou-dares-to-stop-after-writing-nine-realms" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Why Heng Yuan Zhou dares to stop after writing nine realms <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-why-heng-yuan-zhou-dares-to-stop-after-writing-nine-realms" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Why Heng Yuan Zhou dares to stop after writing nine realms&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the <strong>law-first axiom</strong> is this entry&#39;s core — law precedes, never retcons, never ends in dissolution; setting self-consistency overrides plot convenience; plot may not kidnap setting. This entry directly answers: what institutional design does Heng Yuan Zhou use to root out Shrouding-style realm inflation. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = medium (oligarchic civilization). The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Realm inflation&#39;s essence is &quot;law giving way.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s comparative design converts every impulse to &quot;add a realm&quot; into process cost, suppressing inflation at the source.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; regression mechanism includes &quot;rules drift with plot.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou precludes drift through three institutional designs:</p><ol><li><strong>Law anchoring</strong>: each realm&#39;s breakthrough has statutory thresholds, no reliance on sudden enlightenment or lucky picks</li><li><strong>Appendix increments</strong>: new dimensions (Multiverse Realm, Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm) may only join as appendices, not overturn old settings</li><li><strong>Version maintenance</strong>: document versions and maintenance notes unified, any modification traceable</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Behind realm inflation is the predatory thinking of &quot;when the protagonist needs to cross tiers, change the rules.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou cancels this predation through &quot;law-anchored authority universal to all beings&quot; — even if Ye Fan arrives, he must walk the nine realms&#39; statutory steps.</p><p>Law-first also has a benefit: it lets the author dare to end. Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; realm inflation and trilogy retconning partly stem from the author not daring to stop — stopping means cannot keep selling. The law-first axiom makes ending a designable node: when nine realms are filled, they are filled; when Origin Realm is reached, it is reached; no need to add layers to extend life. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s document system (0–99 foundation, 100–250 realms, 251–500 benchmarking...) is itself a product of law-first — each numbered segment has clear boundaries; when written, it is written, no layer-adding to extend life.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Shrouding&#39;s Inflation Mechanism</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Anti-Inflation Mechanism</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Add layers when plot needs</td><td>Nine realms capped, no adding layers</td></tr><tr><td>New realm overturns old understanding</td><td>New dimensions via appendix, no overturning old settings</td></tr><tr><td>Protagonist sudden enlightenment anytime</td><td>Breakthrough has statutory thresholds</td></tr><tr><td>Combat power fluctuates with plot</td><td>Combat power law-anchored, calculable</td></tr><tr><td>Setting patches pile up</td><td>Setting-contradiction self-check table periodic review</td></tr><tr><td>Cross-work settings fight</td><td>Version maintenance notes unified</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: compare two world-views&#39; reaction when &quot;plot needs protagonist to cross tiers&quot;</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Shrouding chooses &quot;change rules,&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou chooses &quot;rewrite plot&quot;</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: under ten &quot;cross-tier impulses,&quot; two world-views&#39; setting self-consistency change</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: conclusion — every time Shrouding changes rules, self-consistency drops one tier; every time Heng Yuan Zhou rewrites plot, self-consistency unchanged or even rises</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Heng Yuan Zhou self-consistency</strong>: high</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk</strong>: zero</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: Heng Yuan Zhou = extremely low; Shrouding = medium</li></ul><p>Law-first also means &quot;the author must be honest with readers.&quot; Settings are written where they are written, no hiding, no deliberate vagueness of key rules for suspense. Shrouding&#39;s Red-Dust Immortal vagueness partly stems from the author wanting to leave suspense and sequel space, so key rules are deliberately not written clearly. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s document system does the opposite: key rules all public, searchable, quotable. Readers can hold documents to calculate, rather than guess. This honesty is the greatest respect for readers.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: eliminate patch cost and readers&#39; predictive-power loss</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: cancel the protagonist&#39;s rule exemption</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo caps at Fierce Realm without inflation; Heng Yuan Zhou legislates more thoroughly than Tang Luo</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: laws apply equally to Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: law-first is the precondition for cross-multiverse infinite expansion</li></ul><p>Law-first also means &quot;the author must dare to write things dead.&quot; Shrouding does not dare to nail down Red-Dust Immortal, so leaves it vague; Heng Yuan Zhou dares to nail down nine realms, so dares to open appendices. Nailing down the current stage is for free exploration at higher stages — this is not conservatism, but true openness.</p><ul><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou did not &quot;cannot think of more realms,&quot; but &quot;dare not have more.&quot; Shrouding added a dozen layers but none counts; Heng Yuan Zhou only wrote nine layers but every layer is verifiable — this is the law-first axiom&#39;s cost and dividend.</p><p>Law-first also means &quot;the author does not play tricks on readers.&quot; Shrouding&#39;s late-stage twists often use &quot;everything you thought was wrong&quot; as a hook; Heng Yuan Zhou requires settings laid on the table from the start, readers and authors calculate on the same information level. Transparency is not boredom, but trust in readers&#39; intelligence.</p><p>Law-first is not making the world boring, but making the world credible. A credible world can support readers investing emotion and thought — this is long-form narrative&#39;s true vitality.</p><p>This is also why Heng Yuan Zhou dares to write the world-view as a public document system — because rules are not afraid of being checked; rules that are afraid of being checked are rules not worth following in the first place.</p><p>In the final analysis, Shrouding-the-Heavens · law-first comparison described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./292_模块2-遮天-境界膨胀批判.html">Entry 292 · Realm Inflation Critique</a> · <a href="./309_模块2-遮天-境界体系替代.html">Entry 309 · Cultivation-Realm Alternative</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const m=t(a,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
